          "summary": "usageCapture accepts caller tokens and preserves product verdicts when recording fails.",
          "rationale": "The core cannot observe agent tokens, so missing costs remain unknown and caller estimates stay labelled. CLI tests prove storage errors preserve green and red exit codes. Git hashes omit untracked file contents.",
          "author": "fm/verilex-run-ledger"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "internal/cli/surface.go",
      "summary": "Record requests with no covering claim without launching an instance.",
